looking at the controller, I think the waitForVolumeAttachmentInternal / waitForVolumeDetachmentInternal / waitForVolumeAttachDetachStatus bits could be minimally tweaked to do the right thing (though I would only do it in 1.20, and only after stabilizing the flaking test):

1. in waitForVolumeAttachmentInternal/waitForVolumeDetachmentInternal:
  * do a list with a metadata.name field selector
  * switch NotFound error checks for len(attachments.Items) == 0 checks
  * pass in the list's resourceVersion to waitForVolumeAttachDetachStatus
2. in waitForVolumeAttachDetachStatus, use `watchtools.NewRetryWatcher` with a metadata.name field selector instead of doing a raw watch

